From 81cdbfd691cfb87a0885032445c91e5c7b94f3e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:51:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] AB monitor 1.6.5: per-meter data audit, identity check,
 ab_check_meters, pyqtgraph prototype

- monitor 1.6.5: warn when a meter reports another IP than the one polled
  (reported_ip(), poll meta reported_ips); data path audited
- tests: emulator 0.0.2 (hosts distinguishable: scale, own IP, serial,
  --report-ip); test_ip_separation 0.0.1 (pages serial per meter, meters in
  parallel, every output keeps its own meter); runner 0.0.3
- ab_check_meters.py 0.0.1: live and CSV comparison of two meters with
  verdict SAME SOURCE / WRONG ADDRESS / NEARLY EQUAL / DIFFERENT
- prototypes/pyqtgraph_live_preview.py 0.0.1: interactive live preview
  (crosshair read-out, zoom, pan, follow newest), staged for 1.7.0
- docs/plans/PLAN_1.7.0_pyqtgraph_and_meter_check.md (+ PDF)

All suites pass on Python 3.12.3 and 3.7.12. Local commit only; not pushed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AKRKdP2fHw4teErHasQB2w
