+4. Memory: curves reused, no pixmaps; run the GUI soak test (widget count and
+   RSS flat), keep `GUI_KEEP_SAMPLES_AFTER_FLUSH`.
+5. Python 3.7 decision: pin PySide6 6.2.4 + pyqtgraph 0.12.4 in
+   `requirements-py37.txt`, or keep 6.5.3 and use the matplotlib fallback on 3.7
+   (the RHEL 9 exporter host does not need the GUI).
+6. Tests: offscreen pyqtgraph GUI test (tabs per meter, curves per unit,
+   crosshair read-out values = store values); docs, manual, kit.
+
